  "description": "ABB B23 three-phase DIN-rail energy meter (B-series; B24 shares this map). Integer measurements in HOLDING registers (FC03), big-endian / high-word-first. 32-bit uint32/int32 for instantaneous values, 64-bit uint64/int64 for energy. Scales are divisors: V/10, A/100, W|var|VA/100, Hz/100, PF/1000; energy raw kWh|kvarh*100 is served as canonical Wh/varh (scale 0.1). Verified register-for-register against two independent open-source integrations (steefan85/ABB_B23_Energy_Meter register map + roastedelectrons/ABBEnergyMeter device CSV, which agree) and consistent with ABB manual 2CDC512084D0101.",
  "source_document": "ABB B23/B24 User Manual 2CMC485003M0201 ch.9 (docs/vendor/meters/abb-b23-b24-user-manual.pdf) — register-for-register confirmed; also cross-checked vs steefan85/ABB_B23_Energy_Meter and roastedelectrons/ABBEnergyMeter",
